<title>USA: Cleveland $139 mln school notes won by J.P. Morgan Securities Inc. [CORRECTED 20:55 GMT]</title>
<headline>Cleveland $139 mln school notes won by J.P. Morgan Securities Inc. [CORRECTED 20:55 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects winner of notes in headline and text from Merrill Lynch.)</p>
<p>J.P. Morgan Securities Inc said Tuesday it won $139 million Cleveland City School District revenue anticipation notes at a true interest cost of 4.8940 percent (corrects from 4.93 percent).</p>
